WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:18.745
Toad raced the horse across the meadow.

2
00:00:18.746 --> 00:00:21.933
Before long, the horse tired.

3
00:00:21.934 --> 00:00:25.015
Toad didn't mind slowing down.

4
00:00:25.016 --> 00:00:29.672
"That awful possum is far behind," he said.

5
00:00:29.673 --> 00:00:33.872
After a few miles, the horse stopped.

6
00:00:33.873 --> 00:00:38.022
"Come on," said Toad, "keep going."

7
00:00:38.023 --> 00:00:42.735
But the horse lowered its head to eat grass.

8
00:00:42.736 --> 00:00:47.338
"I'm hungry too," thought Toad.

9
00:00:47.339 --> 00:00:50.674
Toad got off the horse and walked.

10
00:00:50.675 --> 00:00:54.537
Soon he came to a wide road.

11
00:00:54.538 --> 00:00:57.955
"I don't know which direction to go.

12
00:00:57.956 --> 00:01:02.338
I hope someone comes by," he said.

13
00:01:02.339 --> 00:01:07.554
Far down the road, Toad heard a noise.

14
00:01:07.555 --> 00:01:12.808
It sounded like a faint vroom, vroom!

15
00:01:12.809 --> 00:01:15.938
A cloud of dust came toward him.

16
00:01:15.939 --> 00:01:19.341
"It's a car!" yelled Toad.

17
00:01:19.342 --> 00:01:22.611
Toad jumped up and down.

18
00:01:22.612 --> 00:01:25.872
"Hooray!" he said.

19
00:01:25.873 --> 00:01:28.619
"I'll ask them for a ride.

20
00:01:28.620 --> 00:01:32.073
Badger will be very surprised."

21
00:01:32.074 --> 00:01:35.866
He stepped into the road and waved.

22
00:01:35.867 --> 00:01:38.739
The car slowed down.

23
00:01:38.740 --> 00:01:42.805
Suddenly Toad's knees shook.

24
00:01:42.806 --> 00:01:46.070
"Oh no!" cried Toad.

25
00:01:46.071 --> 00:01:49.752
It was the car from The Red Lion!

26
00:01:49.753 --> 00:01:53.739
"It's the car I stole!" cried Toad.

27
00:01:53.740 --> 00:01:57.351
"It's all over! Back to prison for me!

28
00:01:57.352 --> 00:02:00.944
I'll be in chains!"

29
00:02:00.945 --> 00:02:05.608
Toad fainted and fell in the road.

30
00:02:05.609 --> 00:02:08.467
The car came near and stopped.

31
00:02:08.468 --> 00:02:12.545
"Oh dear! How sad!" said the driver.

32
00:02:12.546 --> 00:02:17.704
"It's a poor old washwoman."
